p></fn></fn-group><sec sec-type="supplementary-material" id="s6"><title>Supplementary material</title><supplementary-material id="supplementary" position="float" content-type="local-data"><object-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1183/23120541.00238-2025.Supp1</object-id><p><bold>Please note:</bold> supplementary material is not edited by the Editorial Office, and is uploaded as it has been supplied by the author.</p><p>Supplementary material <fig id="SS1" position="anchor"><media xlink:href="00238-2025.supplement.pdf"/></fig>00238-2025.supplement</p></supplementary-material></sec><ref-list><title>References</title><ref id="C1"><label>1</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><string-name><surname>Elborn</surname>
